{
  "id": "JDG.18",
  "number": "18",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Fuga Laja Girgweaguutka 18",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mika sea fuga eemeeda Dani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eawoojigiga miighwanyagaan sugoocheanda aba Israeli, nea abeeda eawoojigiga gagakiisa geat eemeeda Dani hearaniischooda ghwanyas heeda jea goobiida, aba gideaba damandida miighwanyas hearaniischooda aba jeeda eemoojiga Israeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeakta eemeeda Dani fih muut milmili aba jeeda mooneeda nyaawa, fuga daruusi, leabu Sora, ea Eshtaoli, ghang'uda gheang'da ng'eanyiita nea gwaneaweesa; ak gwayeesha, “Aweayeena aneaweesiina ng'eanyiida.” Ng'ata ghwahita ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Efraimu, ea gheeh Mika, ak gwalla hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea gwariiksa gheeh Mika, gwajeeng'u ghuuta gheareemaneedida, was siida eemeeda Lawi; hean gwayamsa geat hoowa, ak gwayeesha, “Gweaneey ng'eaha hiji? Gisin naaha aba hiji? Gadiyeadaang'u naaha aba hiji?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha niny saawa, “Nih gidasimaneani Mika gil, nigoonan gadiyeeda, neawooschi ashoohoocheandaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeyeesha niny, “Geemuscheey moasha ASEETA, eanala gideaba gajeanyagaada aba bareanyeakaasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha ashoohoocheanda, “Aweayeena aba hoyyoo naweeda oayaachi gwanda madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat gaweay fugiga was muudiin, ea ghwahita Laisha, ak ghwadaah fuga mida hoowa, nea goobiitpiit nea gaba seayu, gawuurji gidabiideata fuga Sidoni, nea gwandeawa ghweelmeeda nea manda ng'ucheeda, nea manda gil shoadeawa aba badayda ng'eanyiida, nea goombal haleanjeeda, nea ea mooscheayi sea fuga Sidoni, ak gaba siisi ng'ula gadiyeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gabiikta heeda fuga gheanyaawa mida Sora ea Eshtaoli, hean goobearsa fuga gheanyaawa; “Arukuni iita ooyeadu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Ang'eatng'eada eeweaya eeng'ucheewana saawa, aba gideaba sidaayi ng'eanyiida, ak ea miy muuchi; ak ghamneawa agooga gajasiinda? Adiidu goong'arng'ariidayi aba beata jea aweayeena ak ghoaghaschi goombalji ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyooweayi gajarisiina fuga abiitpiit nea gaba seayu, nea ng'eanyiida ea haw aba gideaba niyiin ASEETA geatingeagwa; ng'eanyiida manda gichea ghwashoada aba badayda ng'eanyiida.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eada hoowa fih bughalaji lah, nisar dabita ng'ucheeda, fuga eemeeda Dani, leabu Sora ea Eshtaoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwadiyeada ak ghwadeas museasooniga aba Giriat-yearimu, mida Yuda, ak aba ng'asheanji gaguura hoowa Mahane-dani ea ghoah ghamneawa; ng'ula gwanda badayda Giriat-yearimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwala hoowa ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Efraimu, bwak ea ghwahita gheeh Mika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha fih muut ghayi weay ghoahaak ghaang' ng'eanyiida Laisha, heeda fuga gheanyaawa, “Agooga ghoanali gideaba jeedeaba gheawi gwanda haleanjeeda was sanaamu, asi ghamneawa ooteemsheena gichea asina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayamsa geat hoowa, ak ghwahita heeda gheeda gheareemaneedida, was siida Lawi, ea gheeh Mika, ak googeachi ghwanyas iitaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fugiga was bughalaji lahiin sareeni dabita nyaawa bea ng'ucheedean, nea gaba eemeeda Dani, ghamiinaada aba gidaghuuta mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fugigeanji amuut weay ghwaahaak ghaang' ng'eanyiidean gwadiyeada ak gaweay jeeda gheeda, ak gageanda haleanjeedideanyi was sanaamuun. Ak ghamiinaada ashoohoocheandida aba gidaghuuta gheeda sea fih bughalaji lah sareeni dabita ng'ucheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea niweay jeeda gheeh Mika, ak gageanda haleanjeeda was sanaamu, hean goobearsa ashoohoocheanda, “Agooga goosinyi naaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha saawa, “Ang'iing'i siinda, naba ghuutaang'u ak giyeadu geeshteanya, ak guwoosi siida ghuuteanya, ea ashoohoocheandeanya; ghamneawa ghwadoabiiw aba headaang'u gideaba gaywoosa ashoohoocheanda gheapa siyagi, ghana ng'wana guwoosi ashoohoocheanda eemoojiga sean bea Israeli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gahoosan guroorooda ashoohoocheandida, ak gageanda haleanjeedida was sanaamuun ak gawa goopteada aba bugusta fugiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayam geat ak gaweay, nea diibiga manang'i ea dugwa nyaawa ea dabita nyaawa ghwanung' goosheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata nea nuweay gil geaw aba heeda gheeh Mika, fugiga mida gealga ascheayi gheeh Mikahiin gwaroonyi sea saawa, ak ghwaat geeshta ak ghwanyas orjoogiga Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojuursa orjooga Dani. Ng'ata gwasaju gheatkweaka nyaawa ak gwayeesha Mika, “Gwadukuteawaneeyi naaha ang'iing'i gil ayi bwak ea adeanyeewana fuga deenuuni?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Agooga noogeandi haleanjeeda easinyi was sanaamu, ea ashoohoocheanji, ak ghoang'eachi eeweayeena, ak ea gudu gabeahan naaha? Ak ghwasaan gil ayi bwak ea oopearseani gideaba ‘Gwadukuteawaneeyi naaha?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha orjooga Dani, “Adiidu geayiiy ghuutaang'u aba bugusteanya, adiidu goobisseey fuga nyareeseadi, ea meegeanda eaweagaagu ea gea fugeaba gheang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eat gaweay orjooga Dani; Hean nea ghwadaah Mika gideaba uurjeenga burdeawa niny, ghwayam geaw gabiikta gheanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
