          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanda gidaghayi sin Mika, nea ashoohoocheanda ghayi mideawa, ak gaweay ea ghwahita Laisha, heeda mida fuga mideawa ghweelmeeda nea ghoabit ng'eanyi ak ghabwara ng'aniibanga ng'utkeaka, ak goojoon beasta mujiineeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ea manda lealnoodiga, aba gideaba mujiineedida ea sheageewa Sidoni, nea ea mabareanyi sea fuga suuk, nea mujiineedida gwanda moangoachiyda mida murdeeda Bet-rehobu. Ak gabiikta ghwadeas mujiineedida ak goobiida hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaguura mujiineedida Dani, ghoah giigheambiita ghweanda nyaawa was Dani, sijiilna Israeli; nea abeeda aba mwadi gheawunga mujiineedida geeguura Laisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasissa geat sanaamu orjooga Dani, ak Yonatan, was orjeeda Gershomu, was orjeeda Musa, niny ea orjoagaaschi ghoah ashoohoodiga aba jeeda eemeeda Dani, bwak ea ghoah eaweeda siyaat ghoah giing'oonyanga aba ng'eanyiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geemiinda sanaamu ghayi sin Mika damanda sean gheata mideawa gheeda sibata ASEETA aba Shilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
